    <briefdescription>
<para>Adaptive HNSW Parameter Tuner. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Dynamically adjusts HNSW search parameters based on:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Query latency targets</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Recall requirements</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Dataset size</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Query patterns</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Workload type (OLTP, Analytics, Mixed, RAG)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Performance Gains:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Optimal efSearch selection: +15-25% faster queries at same recall</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Reduced over-searching: -10-20% CPU usage</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Better latency/recall trade-offs</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Workload-specific optimization: +20-35% throughput improvement</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Sources:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Benchmark Analysis: benchmarks/BENCHMARK_ANALYSIS_20251210.md</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Research: docs/de/research/WISSENSCHAFTLICHE_PERFORMANCE_OPTIMIERUNGEN.md</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>HNSW Paper: Malkov &amp; Yashunin (2018)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Performance Tips: docs/knowledge-base/PERFORMANCE_TIPS.md </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
